<p><code>onItemClick</code> callback is memoized by <code>useCallback()</co=
de>. As long as <code>term</code> is the same, <code>useCallback()</code> r=
eturns the same function object.</p>
<p>When <code>MyParent</code> component re-renders, <code>onItemClick</code=
> function object remains the same and doesn't break the memoization of <co=
de>MyBigList</code>.</p>
<p>That was a good use case of <code>useCallback()</code>.</p>
